# Ad-hoc MCP browser scratch output (superseded by frontend/tests/visual/)
.playwright-mcp/

# Markdown documentation is local-only. Only the root README.md is tracked.
*.md
!README.md

# NOTE: gitignore has NO effect on files that are already tracked. These four are still
# in the index and will keep committing until explicitly untracked:
#     git rm --cached docs/DIAGRAMS.md docs/SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md \
#              frontend/DESIGN.md frontend/README.md
# Also note that the tracked README.md links to DESIGN.md and seven docs/*.md files that
# are NOT tracked, so a fresh clone currently gets a README with 7 dead links.
